00:14:15,098 --> 00:14:17,047
Disabled is a configuration state.

248
00:14:17,271 --> 00:14:18,804
A flag value is intent.

249
00:14:19,266 --> 00:14:21,080
Containment is something
you have to prove.

250
00:14:21,711 --> 00:14:25,729
So the next time someone shows
you an AI kill switch, don't ask

251
00:14:25,755 --> 00:14:29,850
whether the button turns red, ask
what happens fifteen seconds later.

252
00:14:30,884 --> 00:14:33,003
Contained is a runtime property

